# This slice's route through the front door — see forgejo/caddy.caddyfile
# for the shape's rationale. The hub's :8090 publish stays as well: the
# agent uses it (localhost, no DNS), and this name is for browsers.
#
# PocketBase pushes live updates over Server-Sent Events, which is an
# ordinary long-lived HTTP response — reverse_proxy handles it with no
# extra config, but it is why a proxy read timeout must never be added here.
@beszel host beszel.lab.twolfe.dev
handle @beszel {
	reverse_proxy beszel:8090
}
